{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8f76e93d-9db4-49c7-b50c-7c34e74b13a1",
    "name": "Vinyl Search API",
    "description": "Importable Postman collection for the backend-go API.\n\nSetup:\n- Set `baseUrl` to the deployed API base URL. It defaults to the frontend dev environment value.\n- Set `authToken` to a valid Cognito ID token for user-protected routes.\n- Set `adminToken` to a valid Cognito ID token for an Admin user for `/admin/*` routes.\n- For image-bearing create/update requests, replace the `temp*ImageUrl*` variables with real uploaded temp object URLs, or replace the `existing*ImageUrl` variables with real permanent image URLs fetched from the API.\n- Array filters on search endpoints are JSON-encoded strings, matching what the frontend submits.\n\nNotes from the current codebase:\n- The frontend has a `POST /users/market/:id/sold` call, but there is no matching backend endpoint, so it is intentionally omitted here.\n- The backend exposes `/forum/search`, while the current frontend search service sends the query to `/forum`. This collection uses the actual backend search endpoint.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://devapi.vinyl.lk"
    },
    {
      "key": "authToken",
      "value": "replace-with-user-id-token"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "replace-with-admin-id-token"
    },
    {
      "key": "userUid",
      "value": "replace-with-user-objectid"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminEmail",
      "value": "member@example.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "recordId",
      "value": "replace-with-record-id"
